+# What is left is the runs with no thread to read -- a workflow reacting to a
+# condition rather than to a request. Every key is REQUIRED: a default would be
+# this file naming an agent, and a project that renamed its engineer would get a
+# run for an agent that does not exist. A missing key fails the pull request's
+# own check.
